<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Tecle – Movement makes momentum</title>

  <!-- Google Font -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-color: #020617;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --accent-soft: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
      --card-bg: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.82);
      --text-main: #e5e7eb;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --border-subtle: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: "Space Grotesk", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1e293b 0, #020617 45%, #000 100%);
      color: var(--text-main);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Animated gradient orbs in the background */
    .orb {
      position: fixed;
      width: 420px;
      height: 420px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      filter: blur(50px);
      opacity: 0.7;
      z-index: -2;
      mix-blend-mode: screen;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .orb.orb-1 {
      background: radial-gradient(circle, #38bdf8, #1d4ed8);
      top: -80px;
      left: -40px;
      animation: float1 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    .orb.orb-2 {
      background: radial-gradient(circle, #a855f7, #ec4899);
      bottom: -120px;
      right: -20px;
      animation: float2 22s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes float1 {
      0%   { transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0); }
      100% { transform: translate3d(60px, 80px, 0); }
    }

    @keyframes float2 {
      0%   { transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0); }
      100% { transform: translate3d(-80px, -40px, 0); }
    }

    .noise {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.08;
      z-index: -1;
      background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 160 160' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='2' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='noStitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.6'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
      mix-blend-mode: soft-light;
    }

    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1120px;
      padding: 32px 20px;
    }

    .card {
      border-radius: 32px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.88), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.96));
      box-shadow:
        0 24px 80px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9),
        0 0 0 1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(26px) saturate(160%);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 2.5fr);
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      border-radius: inherit;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18), rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.06)) border-box;
      mask:
        linear-gradient(#000 0 0) padding-box,
        linear-gradient(#000 0 0);
      mask-composite: exclude;
      opacity: 0.7;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .logo-mark {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.6);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 0 0, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25), rgba(15, 23, 42, 1));
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
    }

    .logo-text {
      font-size: 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .tag {
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .tag-dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.9);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 44px);
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    h1 span.accent {
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, #e0f2fe, #38bdf8, #a855f7);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }

    .slogan {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 460px;
    }

    .slogan strong {
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .divider {
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
      margin: 28px 0 20px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.45), transparent 65%);
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .meta-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .meta-item {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .pill {
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    }

    /* Right column: futuristic "Coming soon" */
    .right {
      border-radius: 26px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.25);
      padding: 22px 20px 20px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98));
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .right::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 200%;
      height: 120%;
      top: -10%;
      left: -50%;
      background: conic-gradient(from 200deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2), transparent, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.22), transparent, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25));
      opacity: 0.65;
      mix-blend-mode: soft-light;
      animation: sweep 18s linear infinite;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    @keyframes sweep {
      0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }

    .status-label {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.9);
    }

    .coming-soon-big {
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-size: 26px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .coming-soon-big span {
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .timeline {
      margin-top: 28px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 14px 14px 12px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.92);
      border: 1px dashed rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5);
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .timeline-label {
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .timeline-main {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .timeline-main strong {
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .progress {
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .progress-label {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .progress-bar-outer {
      width: 100%;
      height: 4px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .progress-bar-inner {
      width: 64%;
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #38bdf8, #a855f7);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.8);
      position: relative;
    }

    .progress-bar-inner::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      top: -3px;
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #e0f2fe;
      box-shadow:
        0 0 10px rgba(56, 189, 248, 1),
        0 0 24px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.6);
    }

    .small-print {
      margin-top: 16px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.8);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .small-print span {
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .email {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--accent);
      border-bottom: 1px dotted rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.5);
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .email:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
      border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.9);
    }

    @media (max-width: 840px) {
      body {
        padding: 16px 0;
      }

      .card {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        padding: 22px 18px 20px;
        border-radius: 26px;
      }

      header {
        flex-direction: row;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .right {
        order: -1;
      }

      .coming-soon-big {
        font-size: 22px;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .wrapper {
        padding-inline: 14px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 20px 16px 18px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 26px;
      }

      .slogan {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .coming-soon-big {
        font-size: 18px;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="orb orb-1"></div>
  <div class="orb orb-2"></div>
  <div class="noise"></div>

  <div class="wrapper">
    <main class="card">
      <!-- Left side: brand & slogan -->
      <section>
        <header>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;">
            <div class="logo-mark">T</div>
            <div>
              <div class="logo-text">Tecle</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="tag">
            <span class="tag-dot"></span>
            Emerging performance brand
          </span>
        </header>

        <h1>
          <span class="accent">Tecle</span><br />
          Movement makes momentum
        </h1>

        <p class="slogan">
          <strong>Tecle – Movement makes momentum.</strong><br />
          Liike ei ole vain seuraus – se on lähtölaukaus kaikkeen, mitä seuraa. Rakennamme jotain, joka kytkee suorituskyvyn, teknologian ja jatkuvan liikkeen yhteen.
        </p>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="meta-row">
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span class="pill">Futuristic • Minimal</span>
          </div>
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span>Verkkoalusta työn alla</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Right side: Coming soon panel -->
      <section class="right">
        <div class="status-label">
          <span class="status-dot"></span>
          Coming soon
        </div>

        <div class="coming-soon-big">
          TECLE <span>•</span> LAUNCH
        </div>

        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline-label">Phase</div>
          <div class="timeline-main">
            <div>
              <strong>Movement layer in progress</strong><br />
              Verkkosivusto & brändin ensimmäinen julkinen versio viimeistelyssä.
            </div>
            <div style="font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0.8;">
              v0.9 • pre-release
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="progress">
          <div class="progress-label">
            <span>Build status</span>
            <span>~64% complete</span>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-bar-outer">
            <div class="progress-bar-inner"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="small-print">
          <span>Movement creates the next frame.</span>
          <span>Pysy kuulolla – Tecle avautuu pian.</span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
